url: https://github.com/pavanamthomas/computational-ml-stem-problem-forge
abstract: >
  A laboratory for original computationally intensive ML, statistical, and STEM
  problems with unambiguous formalization, Python reference solutions,
  independent verification, detection of subtly wrong but numerically
  plausible answers, reproducible ground truth, and AI-generated candidate
  solution audit.
keywords:
  - machine learning
  - ground truth
  - leakage
  - nested cross-validation
  - numerical stability
  - verification
  - adversarial evaluation
